{"rule":"lemma-pool/v1","groups":{"teimoso":{"host":"ec35de90","siblings":["ae8ac04d"]}},"rows":{"ae8ac04d":{"word":"teimosa","rank":9956,"meanings":[{"headword":"teimoso","pos":"adj","source_reference":"kaikki:en-teimoso-pt-adj-0GJca8IG","translation":"obstinate (who does not easily change their opinion or attitude)"},{"headword":"teimoso","pos":"adj","source_reference":"kaikki:en-teimoso-pt-adj-NPmhh66u","translation":"stubborn"}]}},"examples":{"ae8ac04d":{"m":[[{"t":"Tenho sido muitas vezes chamada de teimosa, muito curiosa.","e":"- I have often been called wilful, overly curious.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.833254,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"1af18d720d6ecb6a2ba88355c3a4887f","i":"9423555a7b54d28da2a93fb2ef24f053","r":"5788136:6973762:173:4691319","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5788136","6973762","173"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"A minha mãe pode ser muito teimosa, quando se trata de regras.","e":"My mother can be very obstinate when it comes to rules.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.883614,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"0646de15e400d0c74a7e14c6e2f81b1d","i":"eb4eb11594d33e054062fbc514bbd3a9","r":"5425764:6593784:422:3650102","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5425764","6593784","422"],"w":["leaf",0]}],[{"t":"Crianças, a vossa irmã é como uma vara atrás de uma mula teimosa.","e":"Children... your sister is like a stick behind a stubborn mule.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.834862,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"03641e8c41b9a7d5eaf6930358dad8c0","i":"09b5ea6e60647af36dd19f388b9ff3d0","r":"5689392:6852872:527:4627487","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5689392","6852872","527"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Vê lá se metes isso na tua cabeça dura e teimosa.","e":"Let me get this through your thick, stubborn skull!","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.577683,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"8bdfcc9c04a786b3f720ba76a7e88cd6","i":"179475a9e2f3b70b779752bcf9b45970","r":"3962210:6669643:997:740018","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3962210","6669643","997"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Você é a criatura mais teimosa do mundo.","e":"You are the most stubborn creature on this Earth.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.801679,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"cbaf561b41aa691f2a4d2216d1a5fc7a","i":"53a73ef9176d1ed24c0da723253ccb87","r":"4185230:6280597:196:1056239","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4185230","6280597","196"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Pois, fala a pessoa mais teimosa de sempre.","e":"Yeah, said every stubborn person ever.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.695118,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"d27709f19a6b0b3bf89012405bf2eb26","i":"5be090629780dba3920e2be7b934ea36","r":"5197712:6591603:316:3378430","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5197712","6591603","316"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"E não... não só porque sei que sou teimosa.","e":"And not... Not just because I know that I'm bloody stubborn.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.91294,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"e4127ed3f37afd27b990efee44b19330","i":"66efb820b6cc85bd944ec412c1d60511","r":"6004848:7019562:239:4834924","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6004848","7019562","239"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"És mais do que capaz ou talvez sejas só teimosa.","e":"Surely you're more than capable. Or maybe you're just being stubborn.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.831482,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"a4be3801f59978b736d90f0a9ea592a7","i":"a395aa9f108e7b9b42c6298f4dd92061","r":"5616030:7048916:140:4578408","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5616030","7048916","140"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Se não fosses teimosa, podíamos ter ido para mais longe!","e":"If you hadn't been so stubborn, we could have run farther.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.837089,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"f1b11a4dc914032ed7db7396a46e18f3","i":"a87bf65f4049ade4c361c6307f2f8645","r":"6302160:6927761:1554:4276812","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6302160","6927761","1554"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Ela é teimosa, mas está certa, como sempre.","e":"She's stubborn... But she's right, as usual.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.81133,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"9302314f405721b3fcd32cccdd4dd854","i":"d9b02f3856ed2e836a85212dee38834c","r":"6190648:6932903:566:4954409","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6190648","6932903","566"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Sabes, eu não sei nada acerca de ti. Além do facto de seres teimosa.","e":"- Y'know, I don't know anything about you other than the fact that you're stubborn.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.858956,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"5b32d3401c2ae6334b2ec933a21aac2f","i":"ab974f6377d64cac2a239d5708f1a410","r":"4814760:6933377:464 465:2982682","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4814760","6933377","464 465"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"A minha irmã sempre foi motivo de vergonha para mim. Muito teimosa, não era?","e":"My sister was always a bit of an embarrassment to me.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.828059,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"f933b9252bb437b234266f5c93a5f7b7","i":"31a0a46de31110d9f138a6b6425a0836","r":"3780326:6691142:497 498:566104","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3780326","6691142","497 498"],"w":["leaf",0]}]]}}}